  "targetText": "1. Use the actual source laws, dense core and bounded meanThe three admitted parents supply the same μ,J,ν: the actual all-L2 source mean T and contraction; a genuine dense closable compact-gradient core G with closed graph closure; and the sharp compact gradient energy. The actual conditional S is stationary under ν because it disintegrates the reflected joint law Λ and both Λ marginals are ν. Thus u=φ AE ν also holds AE S_y for AE y. This fiber fact is derived from the actual stationary law, not assumed by a caller.ν=J2,Λ1=Λ2=ν,S∘ν=ν,domG―=L2(ν);u=φ (ν-a.e.)⇒u=φ (Sy-a.e., ν-a.e. y).Corresponding Lean stepL2MacroscopicMean.actual_macroscopic_l2_mean; SourceMeanGradientDomain.literal_source_mean_in_closed_gradient; MacroscopicEnergy.actual_macroscopic_gradient_energy_blocks; Measure.disint",
